  "features": [
    "All 157 pinned JS registry modules have explicit Home ownership; the internal test adapter has its separate contract.",
    "The complete linked registry inventory is validated before artifacts, rejecting missing, extra and duplicate identities.",
    "Native X509 implementation/constructor/prototype compile together under exact linked-header validation.",
    "WASI memory refresh follows actual buffer identity when replacing or growing WebAssembly.Memory."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Registry ownership does not prove API completion or whole-native ownership. The pinned async-frame module is an incomplete facade; current() returns undefined, tracked by #871.",
    "The initial valid WASI replacement-memory test failure is retained without passing credit; the repaired test checks both correct new-memory writes and unchanged old memory.",
    "This verifies ordinary X509/TLS/HTML/async context and valid WASI operations; broader WASI/debugger/HTML, remaining native dependencies, complete suite and Release/ASAN/all-platform verification remain open under #66."
  ],
